Relevant columns, potential usage, and conditions
• "date": filter data starting 2022‑01‑01 and group by calendar month  
• "category_name": human‑readable liquor category needed in the final answer  
• "category": numeric category code (helpful but not strictly required)  
• "volume_sold_liters": base measure to build monthly totals and percentages  
• "invoice_and_item_number": unique product identifier (generally not needed for this task)  
• Conditions you will probably apply  
  – "date" >= '2022‑01‑01'  
  – "date" < DATE_TRUNC('month', CURRENT_DATE)    -- keeps only fully completed months  
  – HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT DATE_TRUNC('month', "date")) >= 24  -- categories with at least 24 months of data  
  – HAVING AVG("pct_of_total") >= 0.01                        -- ≥ 1 % average share  

